{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id165690768"}, "name":{"label":"Wildcat1580"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-19T16:07:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"13866076653"}, "title":{"label":"Buggy since iOS glass release"}, "content":{"label":"This has been my go to step tracking app on my watch forever. Since my watch and phone updated to the latest iOS release with glass the app has been problematic. My watch no longer updates my step count throughout the day. When I tap on the app and open it on my watch, it displays zero steps. I then have to close the app and reopen it before the steps refresh . Sometimes I have to do this two or three times before it actually updates both inside the widget and on my watch face. It appears all the data is there. It’s just that the app is never refreshing unless you’re actively forcing it. I hope the developers fix it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
